389
00:31:58,123 --> 00:32:03,623
With you, Liz, I'm sure your debut will be wonderful. I'm looking forward to it.

390
00:32:03,623 --> 00:32:06,623
As you say, believe in me...

391
00:32:06,623 --> 00:32:11,123
...who believes in thee! Huzzah!

392
00:32:31,123 --> 00:32:36,123
Well, the preparations for the showcase seem to be going smoothly.

393
00:32:36,123 --> 00:32:45,123
So much has happened since we infiltrated Holo. Songs, performances...

394
00:32:45,123 --> 00:32:50,123
...troubles, challenges, and kind words too.

395
00:32:50,123 --> 00:32:59,123
All of them are irreplaceable memories I'll cherish forever.

396
00:32:59,123 --> 00:33:06,123
I want to do my best for my family, my friends, my kingdom...

397
00:33:06,123 --> 00:33:10,123
...and of course, my talented girlies, Justice.

398
00:33:10,123 --> 00:33:14,123
Onwards and upwards!

399
00:33:16,123 --> 00:33:20,123
Flame off.

400
00:33:20,123 --> 00:33:25,123
It has been such a busy day.

401
00:33:25,123 --> 00:33:28,123
Maybe I should rest for a bit.

402
00:33:28,123 --> 00:33:34,123
Yeah, a little... little nap won't hurt anybody.

403
00:33:34,123 --> 00:33:45,123
Raora says I should nap anyways, so it's fine.

404
00:33:47,123 --> 00:33:52,123
一番の宝物 ~Yui final ver.~
Lyrics, Music: 麻枝 准
[Song: My Most Precious Treasure ~Yui final ver.~]
[Lyrics, Music: Jun Maeda]

405
00:34:02,123 --> 00:34:06,123
顔を合わせたら
Whenever we faced each other,

406
00:34:06,123 --> 00:34:10,623
喧嘩してばかり
we did nothing but bicker.

407
00:34:10,623 --> 00:34:16,623
それもいい思い出だった
Even that was a fond memory.

408
00:34:17,123 --> 00:34:22,623
君が教えてくれたんだ もう
Because you were the one who taught me, I'm no longer...

409
00:34:22,623 --> 00:34:25,923
怖くない
...afraid.

410
00:34:25,923 --> 00:34:30,123
どんな不自由でも
No matter what hardships come my way,

411
00:34:30,123 --> 00:34:33,323
幸せは掴める
I can still grasp happiness.

412
00:34:33,323 --> 00:34:37,123
だから
And so...

413
00:34:41,623 --> 00:34:45,123
一人でも行くよ
Even if I am all alone, I will go on,

414
00:34:45,123 --> 00:34:49,323
たとえ辛くても
even if it is painful.

415
00:34:49,323 --> 00:34:53,923
君と見た夢は
The dream I shared with you...

416
00:34:53,923 --> 00:34:57,323
必ず持ってくよ
...I will surely carry it with me.

417
00:34:57,323 --> 00:35:00,123
君とが良かった
I'm so glad it was with you.

418
00:35:00,238 --> 00:35:01,938
あった
I found it...

419
00:35:01,938 --> 00:35:05,738
他の誰でもない
Not with anyone else,

420
00:35:05,738 --> 00:35:09,138
でも目覚めた朝
But when I woke up this morning,

421
00:35:09,138 --> 00:35:13,938
君はいないんだね
you weren't there.

422
00:35:30,538 --> 00:35:33,938
ずっと遊んでる
I felt like we would be playing together forever,

423
00:35:33,938 --> 00:35:38,338
そんな気がしてた
that's what it felt like.

424
00:35:38,338 --> 00:35:41,638
気がしていただけ
But that was only a feeling,

425
00:35:41,638 --> 00:35:45,738
わかってて
even though I already knew.

426
00:35:45,738 --> 00:35:53,538
生まれてきたこと もう後悔はしない
I will never regret being born into this world.

427
00:35:53,538 --> 00:35:57,338
祭りのあとみたい
Like the end of a festival,

428
00:35:57,338 --> 00:36:03,338
寂しいけどそろそろ行こう
it's lonely, but it's time to go.

429
00:36:09,638 --> 00:36:13,338
どこまでも行くよ
I will go on, no matter how far,

430
00:36:13,338 --> 00:36:17,238
ここで知ったこと
holding the things I've learned here close.

431
00:36:17,238 --> 00:36:21,638
幸せという夢
I will make the dream of happiness...

432
00:36:21,638 --> 00:36:25,638
叶えてみせるよ
...come true.

433
00:36:25,638 --> 00:36:29,538
君と離れても
Even if I am parted from you,

434
00:36:29,538 --> 00:36:33,538
どんなに遠くなっても
no matter how far we end up,

435
00:36:33,538 --> 00:36:37,438
新しい朝に
into the new morning,

436
00:36:37,438 --> 00:36:42,138
あたしは生きるよ
I will live on.

437
00:37:17,338 --> 00:37:21,338
一人でも行くよ
I will go on, even all alone,

438
00:37:21,338 --> 00:37:25,138
死にたくなっても
even if I want to die.

439
00:37:25,138 --> 00:37:29,138
声が聞こえるよ
I can hear a voice,

440
00:37:29,138 --> 00:37:33,638
死んではいけないと
telling me that I must not die.

441
00:37:33,638 --> 00:37:37,138
たとえ辛くても
Even if it's painful,

442
00:37:37,138 --> 00:37:41,138
寂しさに泣いても
even if I cry from loneliness,

443
00:37:41,138 --> 00:37:44,938
心の奥には
deep inside my heart,

444
00:37:44,938 --> 00:37:49,138
温もりを感じるよ
I can still feel your warmth.

445
00:37:49,138 --> 00:37:53,338
巡って流れて
Circling and flowing,

446
00:37:53,338 --> 00:37:57,138
時は移ろいだ
time has moved on.

447
00:37:57,138 --> 00:38:01,138
もう何があったか
I can't even remember...

448
00:38:01,138 --> 00:38:05,538
思い出せないけど
...what happened anymore.

449
00:38:05,538 --> 00:38:09,338
目を閉じてみれば
But when I close my eyes,

450
00:38:09,338 --> 00:38:13,538
誰かの笑い声
I can hear someone laughing.

451
00:38:13,538 --> 00:38:17,438
なぜかそれが今
For some reason, that is now...

452
00:38:17,438 --> 00:38:21,938
一番の宝物
...my most precious treasure.

453
00:38:37,338 --> 00:38:45,138
一人でも行くよ
I will go on, even all alone.

454
00:38:53,138 --> 00:39:04,138
どこまでも行くよ
I will go on, no matter how far.

455
00:40:03,493 --> 00:40:05,293
Mm...

456
00:40:05,393 --> 00:40:08,693
Haaah...

457
00:40:08,793 --> 00:40:11,093
Oh, that dream.

458
00:40:11,193 --> 00:40:14,493
What a beautiful, touching song.

459
00:40:14,693 --> 00:40:19,093
You know what? I should probably add that to my showcase.

460
00:40:22,193 --> 00:40:25,693
My showcase! Oh no!

461
00:40:25,793 --> 00:40:28,293
Flame on!

462
00:40:28,393 --> 00:40:32,593
Oh gosh! I'm going to be late for my showcase! What the fudge?!

463
00:40:32,693 --> 00:40:36,093
All right! My showcase, my showcase, my showcase! All right!

464
00:40:36,193 --> 00:40:40,593
Open the door! Let's go! Come on!

465
00:42:15,393 --> 00:42:17,693
Rosarians!

466
00:42:17,793 --> 00:42:20,593
My Bloodflame Kingdom!

467
00:42:20,693 --> 00:42:23,393
How is the performance thus far?

468
00:42:23,493 --> 00:42:27,893
Let me know what you all think using the hashtag ERB3D!

469
00:42:27,993 --> 00:42:31,893
ERB 3D!

470
00:42:31,993 --> 00:42:34,793
What have you loved most thus far?

471
00:42:34,893 --> 00:42:37,593
Is it this beautiful theater?

472
00:42:37,693 --> 00:42:39,893
The Queen Mother Theater?

473
00:42:39,993 --> 00:42:43,493
Named after my mom. Hi Mom! Hello!

474
00:42:43,593 --> 00:42:46,593
Uh, was it Ollie's appearance?

475
00:42:46,693 --> 00:42:48,193
Flayon and Oga's voiceovers?

476
00:42:48,293 --> 00:42:50,593
Kawaikute Gomen sung with Armis?

477
00:42:50,693 --> 00:42:52,693
Giri Giri with Zea?

478
00:42:52,793 --> 00:42:55,493
Oh gosh! It will make me super-duper happy

479
00:42:55,593 --> 00:42:58,093
hearing your thoughts!

480
00:42:58,193 --> 00:43:00,793
And by the way, I can see you all right now!

481
00:43:00,893 --> 00:43:03,693
Oh my gosh, I see you guys!

482
00:43:03,793 --> 00:43:07,193
I see you at the corner of my eye with a magical, invisible

483
00:43:07,293 --> 00:43:10,893
box made by the Rosarian invisible wizards!

484
00:43:10,993 --> 00:43:14,793
So I can see you all right now! Oh my gosh!

485
00:43:14,893 --> 00:43:16,393
This is crazy!

486
00:43:16,493 --> 00:43:20,293
What do- What do you think about my 3D appearance, huh? Huh?

487
00:43:20,393 --> 00:43:24,093
Uh, let me know in chat right now what poses you would like to see.

488
00:43:24,193 --> 00:43:26,693
Yeah, yeah, let me know!

489
00:43:26,793 --> 00:43:30,293
Yeah, let me know. While you're doing that, I'm going to go get Thorn.

490
00:43:30,393 --> 00:43:33,593
Yeah! It's the one, the only,

491
00:43:33,693 --> 00:43:36,693
Thorn!

492
00:43:36,793 --> 00:43:39,293
Hello, I'm Thorn.

493
00:43:39,393 --> 00:43:42,093
Let's do a quick pose with Thorn, shall we?

494
00:43:42,193 --> 00:43:46,193
Ah...

495
00:43:46,293 --> 00:43:52,093
Hazzah! Hazzah!

496
00:43:52,193 --> 00:43:55,093
All right, let's see what you guys have put.

497
00:43:55,193 --> 00:43:58,093
Um...

498
00:43:58,193 --> 00:44:00,493
Huh? A cat pose?

499
00:44:00,593 --> 00:44:04,093
Oh... All- All right, sure!

500
00:44:04,193 --> 00:44:07,093
Let me just put Thorn over here.

501
00:44:07,193 --> 00:44:09,293
Let's take the jacket off for this one.

502
00:44:09,393 --> 00:44:13,093
Flame off!

503
00:44:13,193 --> 00:44:15,693
Uh... Okay. Uh...

504
00:44:15,793 --> 00:44:19,093
I- I need to become Raora...

505
00:44:19,193 --> 00:44:22,193
Nya. Nya, nya!

506
00:44:22,293 --> 00:44:27,093
Nya. Nya, nya, nya! Nya!

507
00:44:27,193 --> 00:44:28,593
Uh, t-pose?

508
00:44:28,693 --> 00:44:32,593
Okay. That one's easy.

509
00:44:32,693 --> 00:44:37,493
Yes, I shall assert my dominance on you all!

510
00:44:37,593 --> 00:44:40,193
Oh! You know what I want to do?

511
00:44:40,293 --> 00:44:42,193
I want to head-pat you all.

512
00:44:42,293 --> 00:44:44,893
Come here. Head-pat. Head-pat, head-pat.

513
00:44:44,993 --> 00:44:50,293
And hug! Hug! We must do this, we must hug!

514
00:44:51,993 --> 00:44:53,593
Hug, hug!

515
00:44:53,693 --> 00:44:56,393
Hug! One more!

516
00:44:56,493 --> 00:44:58,193
We got her, we got her.

517
00:44:58,293 --> 00:45:00,193
Um, let's see...

518
00:45:00,214 --> 00:45:02,714
What else do you want? Victory pose?

519
00:45:02,714 --> 00:45:04,414
Like this?

520
00:45:04,414 --> 00:45:07,714
Yes, I am victorious! For I am...

521
00:45:07,714 --> 00:45:12,014
...the Queen of the Bloodflame Kingdom!

522
00:45:12,014 --> 00:45:13,714
Yeah.

523
00:45:15,714 --> 00:45:20,214
I love you all very much, too. I'm so happy you're all here.

524
00:45:20,214 --> 00:45:22,714
Oh gosh!

525
00:45:24,214 --> 00:45:26,714
Absolute cinema, yes!

526
00:45:27,714 --> 00:45:29,714
Okay.

527
00:45:30,214 --> 00:45:33,214
Oh, a twirl? Okay, we'll do a twirl.

528
00:45:33,214 --> 00:45:34,714
All right.

529
00:45:35,214 --> 00:45:37,214
Yes.

530
00:45:37,214 --> 00:45:39,214
A twirl...

531
00:45:39,714 --> 00:45:41,714
Wow!

532
00:45:43,214 --> 00:45:46,714
Is that okay? A twirl.

533
00:45:47,214 --> 00:45:48,714
Jazz hands.

534
00:45:49,214 --> 00:45:52,214
A spin? Spin, twin!

535
00:45:55,714 --> 00:45:58,414
Oh gosh. A curtsy? Oh, that's a good one.

536
00:46:00,214 --> 00:46:04,714
Like this... A curtsy.

537
00:46:07,714 --> 00:46:10,214
And a bow.

538
00:46:12,714 --> 00:46:16,714
Cute? Hey, you mean, you mean powerful, right?

539
00:46:16,714 --> 00:46:19,714
Powerful! Yes, yes, yes, powerful!

540
00:46:22,014 --> 00:46:25,014
I know you guys also like my shocked face.

541
00:46:25,014 --> 00:46:27,714
So let me just think of something really shocking.

542
00:46:27,714 --> 00:46:30,214
Um...

543
00:46:30,714 --> 00:46:35,214
What the frig!

544
00:46:35,214 --> 00:46:38,214
What the frig!

545
00:46:38,214 --> 00:46:42,714
What the frig? Time is nearly up for poses!

546
00:46:44,414 --> 00:46:48,414
I guess it's time for the next song.

547
00:46:48,414 --> 00:46:50,414
Would you like to hear another song?

548
00:46:50,414 --> 00:46:52,214
Yes, sure you do!

549
00:46:52,214 --> 00:46:56,214
All right, just wait one moment. I need some bits and bobs for this one.

550
00:46:56,714 --> 00:46:58,414
All right.

551
00:46:58,414 --> 00:47:01,714
Some bits and the bobs and the bobs and the bits.

552
00:47:03,214 --> 00:47:05,214
Pa-ba-da-pa-da.

553
00:47:05,214 --> 00:47:07,214
All right.

554
00:47:07,214 --> 00:47:09,714
Here we go. Here's the bits and the bobs.

555
00:47:10,214 --> 00:47:12,014
I have a stand.

556
00:47:12,014 --> 00:47:14,414
It's my mic! Look at that!

557
00:47:14,414 --> 00:47:16,714
And I have a guitar.

558
00:47:19,714 --> 00:47:22,714
Ha! I'm so kakkoii!
Ha! I'm so cool!

559
00:47:22,714 --> 00:47:24,214
All right.

560
00:47:24,214 --> 00:47:28,714
Uh, let's go with a cute... I mean, a powerful song next.

561
00:47:28,714 --> 00:47:31,414
Please listen to...

562
00:47:31,414 --> 00:47:34,714
私の恋はホッチキス
My Love is a Stapler

563
00:47:34,714 --> 00:47:37,714
The next song is My Love is a Stapler.

564
00:47:37,714 --> 00:47:39,714
Let's go!

565
00:47:56,614 --> 00:48:00,514
なんてなんだろう 気気になる理由は
What could it be, the reason I'm curious...

566
00:48:00,514 --> 00:48:03,414
君への この想い
...is these feelings for you.

567
00:48:03,414 --> 00:48:07,214
便箋に書いてみるよ
I will try writing them in a letter.

568
00:48:11,614 --> 00:48:15,314
もしかして 気まぐれかもしれない
Could it be that it's just a whim?

569
00:48:15,314 --> 00:48:20,814
それなのに 枚数だけ増えていくよ
But despite that, the number of sheets keeps growing.

570
00:48:25,414 --> 00:48:28,314
好きの確率 割り出す
To calculate the probability of love,

571
00:48:28,314 --> 00:48:32,614
計算式あればいいのに
if only there was a formula...

572
00:48:39,714 --> 00:48:43,914
キラキラ光る願い事も
Even shining, glittering wishes

573
00:48:43,914 --> 00:48:48,214
ぐちゃぐちゃへたる悩み事も
and messy, exhausted worries...

574
00:48:48,214 --> 00:48:51,714
そうだ ホッチキスでとじちゃおう
That's right, let's staple them together!

575
00:48:51,714 --> 00:48:55,214
とじちゃおう！
Let's staple them!

576
00:48:55,214 --> 00:48:58,714
はじめの一歩だけは軽いノリで
Taking only the first step with a light attitude,

577
00:48:58,714 --> 00:49:02,714
知らないうちに熱くなって
before I know it, I've grown passionate.

578
00:49:02,714 --> 00:49:07,714
もう針がなかったら通らない
If there are no staples left, it won't work,

579
00:49:07,714 --> 00:49:11,714
また明日
see you tomorrow!

580
00:49:24,714 --> 00:49:27,714
どうしようかな
What should I do?

581
00:49:27,714 --> 00:49:31,014
読み返してみるの 恥ずかしい
It's embarrassing to read it over,

582
00:49:31,014 --> 00:49:34,714
あれこれと 便箋に
even though I wrote all sorts of things...

583
00:49:34,714 --> 00:49:38,414
書いたくせに
...on the letter sheets.

584
00:49:39,714 --> 00:49:45,014
気持ちごと ゴミ箱行きじゃなんだか
If I throw my feelings into the trash can,

585
00:49:45,014 --> 00:49:49,014
この胸が切ないから
my chest would ache so much.

586
00:49:49,014 --> 00:49:53,214
持っていようかな
Maybe I'll keep them with me...

587
00:49:53,214 --> 00:49:58,414
今の気持ちを表す 辞書にもない
...to express my current feelings that aren't even in the dictionary.

588
00:50:00,235 --> 00:50:01,535
...ない
...even...

589
00:50:01,535 --> 00:50:04,735
言葉
for words...

590
00:50:04,735 --> 00:50:08,435
探すよ
I will search.

591
00:50:08,735 --> 00:50:09,835
One, two, three!

592
00:50:09,835 --> 00:50:12,935
ワクワクしちゃう計画とか
Exciting plans or...

593
00:50:12,935 --> 00:50:16,435
グダグダすぎる展開とか
totally messy developments...

594
00:50:16,435 --> 00:50:20,435
ぜんぶホッチキスで
Let's staple them all and...

595
00:50:20,435 --> 00:50:23,735
とじちゃおう
bind them together!

596
00:50:23,735 --> 00:50:27,435
今日のできごと 思い出して
Remembering today's events,

597
00:50:27,435 --> 00:50:31,435
いつも心が キュンとなって
my heart always skips a beat.

598
00:50:31,435 --> 00:50:34,735
もう針がないから
Now that there are no staples left,

599
00:50:34,735 --> 00:50:37,735
買わなくちゃ
I have to buy some.

600
00:50:37,735 --> 00:50:40,235
ララ また明日
La la, see you tomorrow!

601
00:51:08,235 --> 00:51:11,735
キラキラひかる願い事も
Sparkling wishes and...

602
00:51:11,735 --> 00:51:15,235
グチャグチャへたる悩み事も
messy, depressing worries...

603
00:51:15,235 --> 00:51:19,235
そーだホッチキスで
That's right, with a stapler,

604
00:51:19,235 --> 00:51:22,435
とじちゃおう
let's bind them together!

605
00:51:22,435 --> 00:51:26,435
はじまりだけは 軽いノリで
It only started as something casual,

606
00:51:26,435 --> 00:51:30,435
しらないうちに あつくなって...
but before I knew it, it became passionate.

607
00:51:30,435 --> 00:51:34,035
もう針がなんだか
Somehow, the staples...

608
00:51:34,035 --> 00:51:37,035
通らない
won't go through anymore.

609
00:51:37,035 --> 00:51:39,735
ララ また明日
La la, see you tomorrow!

610
00:51:58,735 --> 00:52:03,035
And that was "My Love is a Stapler"!

611
00:52:03,035 --> 00:52:06,035
How was it? Did you like my guitar playing?

612
00:52:07,235 --> 00:52:09,735
Well, you guys know this,

613
00:52:09,735 --> 00:52:11,235
but...

614
00:52:11,235 --> 00:52:13,235
I'm actually...

615
00:52:13,235 --> 00:52:15,235
a professional air guitarist!

616
00:52:15,235 --> 00:52:17,035
I know, I know!

617
00:52:17,035 --> 00:52:18,735
Surprise, shocker!

618
00:52:18,735 --> 00:52:20,735
Professional air guitarist here.

619
00:52:20,735 --> 00:52:22,735
Look out!

620
00:52:22,735 --> 00:52:24,235
Anyhoo...

621
00:52:24,235 --> 00:52:27,735
Now it's time for an announcement!

622
00:52:27,735 --> 00:52:29,035
Everyone,

623
00:52:29,035 --> 00:52:30,235
let's call...

624
